					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-619509#post-1700791</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-619509/though-i-walk-through-the-valley#post-1700791</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 01 Feb 2013 19:40:14 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Anaxagoras</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1019930</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>No. The idea is that this is a guy's journal of his experiences released from the tower in the hopes of convincing his family to join him. Or possibly, it's all a fiction written by the tower to lure people there. I included a couple things suggesting that, although it's not a major element of the tale.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
